  SpeakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69db653b1f999eb44866dccb33e341e1, type: 3}
  DialogueText: You turn to a tree with your hand held outward. Cold air surges down
    your arm and comes out in the form of three icicles. You splay your fingers further
    and the icicles go flying into the tree, each one landing in a perfect vertical
    line. It seems the boy enjoyed your routine!
